[288.325659, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe script runs in\u001b[22Ga real browser and writes the translat\u001b[61Gd lab\u001b[67Gl\u001b[69G. Checking autoplay a\u001b[93Gtaking\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bscreenshots:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mFrontend looks\u001b[18Gright;\u001b[25Gautoplay\u001b[34Gadvanced\u001b[43Gto\u001b[46Gslide\u001b[52G2\u001b[54Gafter\u001b[60G6\u001b[62Gs.\u001b[65GComparing\u001b[75Gagainst\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Gstatic\u001b[94Gdesign:\r\u001b[7C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[1m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shel\u001b[27G com\u001b[32Gand \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BThe d\u001b[9Gsign match is pixel-identical (the mi\u001b[47Gs\u001b[49Gng\u001b[52G\"Kiswahili\" link is expected, since \u001b[89Ghe sit\u001b[96G has only\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bone\u001b[7Glanguage).\u001b[18GI'm\u001b[22Gchecking\u001b[31Gwhat's\u001b[38Gavailable\u001b[48Gto\u001b[51Glog\u001b[55Gin\u001b[58Gon\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gbackend\u001b[73Gnext.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'll put Playwright for Python in a scratchpad venv\u001b[55G(driving the system Chrome) and use\u001b[91Ga\u001b[93Gtemporary\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Badmin\u001b[9Gaccount\u001b[17Gthat\u001b[22GI\u001b[24Gremove\u001b[31Gafterwards.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommand…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ S=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-lina-wolf-projects-typo3-t3ca-2026-demo/d2737cda-3ea2-4960-9fb2-76819cdbde\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1